			<heading>
				Eliphaz Speaks: Job’s Wickedness Is Great
			</heading>
			<begin-paragraph>
			</begin-paragraph>
			<v n="1">Then<crossref let="z" cid="c18022001.1" />Eliphaz the Temanite answered and said :</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18022002">
			</marker>
			<v n="2">Surely he who is wise is profitable to himself .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18022003">
			</marker>
			<v n="3">or is it gain to him if you<crossref let="b" cid="c18022003.1" />make your ways blameless ?</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18022004">
			</marker>
			<v n="4">and<crossref let="c" cid="c18022004.1" />enters into judgment with you ?</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18022005">
			</marker>
			<v n="5">There is no end to your iniquities .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18022006">
			</marker>
			<v n="6">
				<crossref let="e" cid="c18022006.2" />and stripped the naked of their clothing .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18022007">
			</marker>
			<v n="7">and you have<crossref let="f" cid="c18022007.1" />withheld bread from the hungry .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18022008">
			</marker>
			<v n="8">and<crossref let="h" cid="c18022008.2" />the favored man lived in it .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18022009">
			</marker>
			<v n="9">and<crossref let="j" cid="c18022009.2" />the arms of<crossref let="k" cid="c18022009.3" />the fatherless were crushed .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18022010">
			</marker>
			<v n="10">and sudden terror overwhelms you ,</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18022011">
			</marker>
			<v n="11">and a<crossref let="n" cid="c18022011.2" />flood of<crossref let="o" cid="c18022011.3" />water covers you .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18022012">
			</marker>
			<v n="12">See<crossref let="p" cid="c18022012.1" />the highest stars , how lofty they are !</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18022013">
			</marker>
			<v n="13">Can he judge through<crossref let="r" cid="c18022013.2" />the deep darkness ?</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18022014">
			</marker>
			<v n="14">and he walks on the vault of heaven . ’</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18022015">
			</marker>
			<v n="15">that wicked men have trod ?</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18022016">
			</marker>
			<v n="16">their foundation was washed away .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18022017">
			</marker>
			<v n="17">and<crossref let="v" cid="c18022017.2" />‘ What can the Almighty do to us ? ’</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18022018">
			</marker>
			<v n="18">but<crossref let="w" cid="c18022018.1" />the counsel of the wicked is far from me .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18022019">
			</marker>
			<v n="19">the innocent one<crossref let="y" cid="c18022019.2" />mocks at them ,</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18022020">
			</marker>
			<v n="20">and what they left<crossref let="z" cid="c18022020.1" />the fire has consumed . ’</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18022021">
			</marker>
			<v n="21">thereby good will come to you .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18022022">
			</marker>
			<v n="22">and<crossref let="d" cid="c18022022.2" />lay up his words in your heart .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18022023">
			</marker>
			<v n="23">if you<crossref let="g" cid="c18022023.3" />remove injustice far from your tents ,</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18022024">
			</marker>
			<v n="24">and gold of<crossref let="i" cid="c18022024.2" />Ophir among the stones of the torrent-bed ,</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18022025">
			</marker>
			<v n="25">and your precious silver .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18022026">
			</marker>
			<v n="26">and<crossref let="k" cid="c18022026.2" />lift up your face to God .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18022027">
			</marker>
			<v n="27">and you will<crossref let="m" cid="c18022027.2" />pay your vows .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18022028">
			</marker>
			<v n="28">and<crossref let="n" cid="c18022028.1" />light will shine on your ways .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18022029">
			</marker>
			<v n="29">but he saves<crossref let="o" cid="c18022029.1" />the lowly .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18022030">
			</marker>
			<v n="30">who will be delivered through<crossref let="q" cid="c18022030.2" />the cleanness of your hands . ”</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18022031">
			</marker>
